  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Yellow curry serves 4 and takes about 40 minutes. The curry uses ground turmeric (no slug, add 2 teaspoons to the paste) and waxy potatoes (no slug, use 3 medium potatoes peeled and cubed) alongside chicken and "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "coconut milk",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "coconut-milk"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". It is the mildest of the Thai curries, making it a good entry point for those new to the flavour profile."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Parboil the potato cubes for 5 minutes before adding them to the curry. This ensures they are fully tender by the time the chicken is cooked through."
          }
        ]
      },
